cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Design System Artefacts Dataset"
version: 1.0.0
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Aleksić
    given-names: Stefan B.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-1537-296X"
abstract: >-
  Measured artefacts of design systems and UI libraries in public GitHub repositories:
  design tokens, components, stories, Storybook, Figma Code Connect, tests, accessibility
  checkers, governance files, frameworks, npm exports field and semantic-version tags.
  Release values come from a dated evidence run, one JSON file per repository.
keywords:
  - design systems
  - design tokens
  - UI libraries
  - software artefacts
